<p>Fire a glowing orb of light at each enemy within your Radiance.  Each orb will slowly follow its target until it connects, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">28, 38, 46, 52, 58</acronym> light damage to anything else it contacts along the way.  When the target is reached the orb will explode dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">152, 205, 246, 281, 311</acronym> light damage in radius 1 and healing you for 50% of the damage dealt.</p><p>All targets struck by your Judgement will be blighted by light, reducing saves by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">28, 38, 46, 52, 58,</acronym> reducing critical power by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">22%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 46%,</acronym> and causing light damage received to splash in radius 2 for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">21%, 32%, 39%, 45%, 49%</acronym> damage against all hostile targets for 4 turns.</p>